    "_dynamic_key_fields": "Data fields whose *value* is a Rules key resolved at runtime rather than written as a literal in the source. Game.gd rolls loot with Rules.value(String(entry['scaled_by'])), so a key that only ever appears in a scaled_by field is genuinely read even though no literal call names it. validate_data.py cross-checks this list against the non-literal Rules.value() call sites it finds, so adding a second dynamic reader without listing it here is itself an error.",
    "dynamic_key_fields": [
      "scaled_by"
    ]
  },
